   "widgets_values": [
    "Pixel art video game sprite animation. The character from the start image, full side profile facing the right side of the image, nose pointing right, walks in place like a video game walk cycle: the legs step forward and back one after another with big, clear, full strides, the arms swing, the body bobs gently, and it never moves across the frame. The camera is completely static and locked off: no zoom, no pan, no rotation. The character stays centred and the same size, keeps facing the same direction the whole time, never turns around, and the whole body stays in frame. Plain flat white background, no shadow, no ground, crisp pixel art, flat colours, no motion blur."
   ],
   "title": "e walk prompt"
